@search = http://localhost:7003
@indexing = http://localhost:7002
@ingestion = http://localhost:7001
@feeder = http://localhost:7004


### SEARCH — health
GET {{search}}/status


### SEARCH — basic keyword search
GET {{search}}/search?q=sea


### SEARCH — search with filters
GET {{search}}/search?q=sea&language=en&offset=0&limit=20


### SEARCH — combined filters
GET {{search}}/search?q=sea&author=melville&language=en


### SEARCH — pagination
GET {{search}}/search?q=sea&offset=20&limit=20


### SEARCH — invalid limit, expected 400
GET {{search}}/search?q=sea&limit=500


### SEARCH — missing q, expected 400
GET {{search}}/search


### SEARCH — available filters
GET {{search}}/search/filters


### SEARCH — one book
GET {{search}}/books/1342


### SEARCH — invalid book id, expected 400
GET {{search}}/books/abc


### INDEXING — health
GET {{indexing}}/status


### INDEXING — status
GET {{indexing}}/index/status


### INDEXING — update one book
POST {{indexing}}/index/update/1342


### INDEXING — rebuild complete index
POST {{indexing}}/index/rebuild


### INGESTION — health
GET {{ingestion}}/status


### FEEDER — health
GET {{feeder}}/status